  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "MolmoAct-Pretraining-Mixture",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMolmoAct - Pretraining Mixture\n\t\n\nData Mixture used for MolmoAct Pretraining. Contains a subset of OXE formulated as Action Reasoning Data along with auxiliary robot data and link to Multimodal Web data.\nMolmoAct is a fully open-source action reasoning model for robotic manipulation developed by the Allen Institute for AI. MolmoAct is trained on a subset of OXE and MolmoAct Dataset, a dataset with 10k high-quality trajectories of a single-arm Franka robot performing 93 unique\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/MolmoAct-Pretraining-Mixture.",
  "alternateName": [
    "allenai/MolmoAct-Pretraining-Mixture"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Ai2",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/allenai"
  },
